  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you use Sanctified Mark, you can declare a creature known to you as the target, ignoring all range, sight, and cover restrictions. If the target is on another plane of existence, you learn which one.</p><p>Additionally, you cannot have Disadvantage on Attack Rolls against the the target of Sanctified Mark.</p>",
